{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scanpy 1.11.2 中，当 chunked=true 时，会执行增量 PCA，并自动进行零中心化。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "chunked\n        If `True`, perform an incremental PCA on segments of `chunk_size`.\n        Automatically zero centers and ignores settings of `zero_center`, `random_seed` and `svd_solver`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "因此，在 chunked=true 的条件下，你设置的 zero_center=false 和 svd_solver=arpack 会被忽略，不会按你的设定生效。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Automatically zero centers and ignores settings of `zero_center`, `random_seed` and `svd_solver`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "只有当 chunked=false 时，zero_center 和 svd_solver 才会被考虑；此时 zero_center=false 会执行截断 SVD 而不是 PCA。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "If `False`, perform a full PCA/truncated SVD (see `svd_solver` and `zero_center`)."
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "zero_center\n        If `True`, compute (or approximate) PCA from covariance matrix.\n        If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：截断 SVD 分支的完整条件需要 chunked=false 且 zero_center=false，仅凭 zero_center=false 不能单独确定该分支；这属于可检测性局限，不代表无条件成立。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "zero_center\n        If `True`, compute (or approximate) PCA from covariance matrix.\n        If `False`, performa a truncated SVD instead of PCA."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "clarifying_question": ""
}
